# Language — English default; pt-BR product UI only

Full guide: [docs/LANGUAGE.md](../../docs/LANGUAGE.md)

## Non-negotiable

| Write in **English** | Write in **pt-BR** (product UI only) |
|---|---|
| Code, identifiers, comments, tests | Labels, buttons, headings, toasts, form errors |
| Docs, BACKLOG, ADRs, README, agent rules | Public tenant pages (`public/tenants/{slug}/`) |
| Commits, PR titles, API paths, JSON keys | Admin/login UI (`components/app/`, `pages/login.vue`) |
| Logs, internal exceptions | `error.vue` user messages |
| | API/email text **returned to users** |

## Agents

- Never add Portuguese to code comments or documentation (translate legacy lines when you touch them).
- Never add English user-facing copy in the product UI unless explicitly requested.
- Login error messages, contact validation, invite emails → **pt-BR**, generic (no user enumeration).
